  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-template-checker> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#SoftwareAgent> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-template-checker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Shell checks run by the organism thread: curl of each published template, grep counts of each namespace, and nanopub-skill check-nanopub-conformance.py against records built from Delphi v2.0 terms." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-template-checker> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "organism-design/nanopubs/build.mjs" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-template-checker> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
}
<http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/pubinfo> {
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-10-31T15:48:40.100Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-template-checker> .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A nanopub whose assertion uses Project Delphi v2.0 terms cannot instantiate the template its pipeline declares, because the published claim, evidence-item and rubric-assessment templates still use legacy ProbKnow terms, so every such declaration is a false statement about how the record was made." .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://purl.org/nanopub/x/hasNanopubType> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/Claim> .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://purl.org/nanopub/x/introduces> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/delphi-v2-template-declarations-are-false> .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/domain> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/organism-anatomy-blueprints-from-ontologies> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/organism-anatomy-blueprints-from-ontologies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/domain/organism-anatomy-blueprints-from-ontologies" .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No assertion, provenance or pubinfo template is declared. The pipeline maps each Project Delphi v2.0 class to the published ProbKnow template for that class, and those published templates still use legacy probknow terms, so a v2.0 record cannot instantiate them: check-nanopub-conformance.py reports every assertion triple unmatched and the required statement missing. Migrated templates exist in the ontology source but have not been republished; see the record delphir:claim/delphi-v2-template-declarations-are-false for the counts and the options." .
  <http://purl.org/nanopub/temp/np1/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Owner ORCID not set: no human is named in this draft. The key owner passes --owner <orcid IRI> to organism-design/nanopubs/build.mjs at signing time, and that one value populates dct:creator and prov:actedOnBehalfOf." .
}
